Number 13 - Roman to Integer
After mapping each Roman numeral to its respective integer in a dictionary, it walks through the 
string one numeral at a time. For each numeral it checks it against the next and if its smaller
than it,it subtracts it, Otherwise it adds it. The last numeral is always added as theres
nothing after it to compare it to.
